        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Max Gail, Jim Moody, Nicollette Sheridan, Nick Mancuso, Boyd Kestner, Michael Cavanaugh, Richard Lineback, Adam Baldwin, Mr. T, Charlie Barnett, Gary Busey, Marsha Warfield, Whitman Mayo\n- Works: D.C. Cab, Somebody's Daughter, Barney Miller\n- Roles: Detective Stan \"Wojo\" Wojciehowicz, Arnie\n\nFacts:\n- In 1983, the American comedy film D.C. Cab starred Max Gail, Adam Baldwin, Mr. T, Charlie Barnett, Gary Busey, Marsha Warfield, and Whitman Mayo.\n- In 1983, Jim Moody appeared in D.C. Cab as Arnie, a member of the rival cab company Emerald Cab.\n- Max Gail is most notable for portraying Detective Stan \"Wojo\" Wojciehowicz on the television sitcom Barney Miller.\n- In 1992, the television film Somebody's Daughter starred Nicollette Sheridan, Nick Mancuso, Boyd Kestner, Michael Cavanaugh, Max Gail, and Richard Lineback.",
